<http://data.silknow.org/event/bd85aa82-c400-3293-a855-1d7e49c9150e>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This design was exhibited by R. Atkinson & Co. in the 1851 Great Exhibition (Class XV, No. 256) in blue and gold. It is engraved in 'The Illustrated Inventor', 31 October 1857, as a product of the Dublin School of Design, on the committee of which Mr Atkinson, 'Her Majesty's Poplin Manufacturer', offered premiums for designs."@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/2ea454be-dd90-3c45-96f4-cc7f73841034> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "This design was exhibited by R. Atkinson & Co. in the 1851 Great Exhibition (Class XV, No. 256) in blue and gold. It is engraved in 'The Illustrated Inventor', 31 October 1857, as a product of the Dublin School of Design, on the committee of which Mr Atkinson, 'Her Majesty's Poplin Manufacturer', offered premiums for designs."@en .
